  "text": "Hello? Ender? Hello? Sorry, I can't hear you very well. Your voice is very low, and the video stops. I think the connection is bad. Can you stop your video, please? Okay... Can you say something now? Yes! Now I can hear you. It is much better. Okay, can we start? First, the new date for the change.",
