 {
  "text": "I can only speak English. I can't speak Portuguese, Hindi or Spanish. But on our global calls, there are people from ten countries. So I have a rule: I always speak slowly, and I use short sentences. And I always say: if you can't understand, write in the chat, or ask me to repeat. It is not a problem. A good call is a call that everybody can understand.",
